        "text": "Shirley Chisholm was elected to Congress in 1968.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Before entering formal politics, Shirley Chisholm had been a teacher.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Both of Shirley Chisholm's parents were from the Caribbean.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
