        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Electing someone to Congress requires a formal political process involving elections.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Being 'first' in a demographic category implies historical significance and recognition.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Biographical details like parental origin contribute to understanding a public figure's background.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'African-American' refers to people of Black descent born in the United States.",
        "confidence": 0.87
