        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Poverty and deprivation are significant life experiences that shape personal identity and values.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The term 'depths of poverty and deprivation' conveys a meaningful and recognizable level of suffering.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The listener will understand that growing up in the British West Indies implies a specific socio-economic context relevant to the speaker's narrative.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Sharing personal family history establishes credibility or authenticity in a discussion about hardship.",
        "confidence": 0.89
