    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81089.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "We had no idea that Shirley Chisholm had ambitions to become president of the United States of America. And we found that out after we've made political endorsements. And so in our country, while it might be considered an asset to be black and to be a woman, not all the women voted for her and not all the black supported her.",
