    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81089.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Shirley Chisholm did manage surprisingly strong showings in some state primaries and carried 151 delegates, winning the right to speak from the main podium at the 1972 Democratic Convention in Miami. But in the end, she did not win the Democratic Party nomination.",
