    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/1/81089.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "Shirley Chisholm had a great sense of humor and there were times that she was able to take away from the monotonous endless speeches on the floor and to share a joke or two with many of us and so she was a woman of all seasons. And her presence when she left the Congress was actually missed by Republicans, as well as Democrats, because she was one lively member of the United States Congress.",
